# The @rlrml/* packages here are generated from the vendored subtr-actor
# submodule (scripts/ensure-subtr-vendor populates them locally; the Nix web
# build pulls them straight from the submodule flake). Their built output
# (dist/, *.wasm, *.js, *.d.ts, public/, docs/, ...) is NOT committed — only the
# package.json manifests (so the npm lockfile's file: deps resolve) and the
# .subtr-actor-rev marker. Ignore everything, re-include directories so git
# descends, then keep the manifests + marker.
*
!*/
!@rlrml/.subtr-actor-rev
!@rlrml/*/package.json

# @rocket-sense/mistakes is first-party (built from crates/rocket-sense-
# mistakes-wasm by scripts/build-mistakes-vendor) and its output IS committed,
# so npm ci and the Nix web build work without extra toolchain wiring. The
# gzipped reranker artifact (synced from the crate's golden fixtures by the
# same script) is committed for the same reason.
!@rocket-sense/mistakes/package.json
!@rocket-sense/mistakes/*.js
!@rocket-sense/mistakes/*.d.ts
!@rocket-sense/mistakes/*.wasm
!@rocket-sense/mistakes/mistake_models.json.gz
